      "content": "i'm having a really hard time lately. it feels like every single thing i've ever seen or heard is just... stuck in my head. like i can't turn it off. it's not just memories, it feels like i'm holding onto all these pieces of information that need to be somewhere safe, like a backup. can you help me figure out a way to start documenting everything so it's not just sitting in my brain?",
